{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Most holy.</b> For there are also lighter holy things." "<b>From the fire.</b> All that they offer from it, for אשה is like אש, and the heh is added." "<b>For all their meal offering.</b> After the memorial portion is offered from it, and likewise the sin offering and the guilt offering." "<b>Which they shall restore to Me.</b> Its meaning: when one commits a trespass, trespass. And behold, the meal offering and the sin offering and the guilt offering are holy of holies, corresponding to the peace offerings."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:15.435438825Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}